  "steps": [
    "Bring a large pan of salted water to the boil and cook the soba noodles until al dente. Drain and run under cool water to stop the cooking.",
    "While the noodles cook, scoop out the avocado flesh and add to a blender with the lime zest and juice, garlic, ginger, and coriander. Blitz until smooth, adding 2–3 tablespoons of water if needed to loosen.",
    "Season the sauce well, then toss with the sesame oil and noodles.",
    "Serve sprinkled with diced red chilli and sesame seeds, if using."
  ],
  "notes": "Add crispy chilli oil or extra sliced chillies if you like things extra spicy."
}
